# git-stats collection archive, written here by ~/stats/check-augur.sh.
#
# Views, clones, referrers and the stargazer list are owner-only analytics, and
# they include other people's names and email addresses. This repository is
# public, so committing the archive would publish them.
#
# The leading slash is deliberate: an unanchored `data/` would also match a
# demo/data/ or docs/data/ that is meant to be committed.
/data/
